# Vendored binary / asset files — never apply text or line-ending conversion,
# so they stay byte-identical across platforms (matters for reproducible builds
# and asset integrity: ONNX models, ORT WASM runtime, self-hosted fonts).
*.wasm binary
*.onnx binary
*.woff2 binary
# The vendored ONNX Runtime loader is minified third-party JS — treat as binary
# so Git never rewrites its line endings (CRLF<->LF) on checkout.
public/ort-wasm/*.mjs binary
